{
	"nodes": [
		{"id":"title","type":"text","text":"← [[计划蓝图|返回计划总入口]]　·　文字说明见 [[BOSSAI计划蓝图]]\n\n# Boss AI 架构（待审阅）\n\n**整张图均为计划，不代表当前代码已实现。**\n\n核心目标：Boss 换 Pawn 形态时，ASC、属性、Buff、冷却、阶段、目标与仇恨连续；行为树只决定做什么，GAS 决定能不能做并负责执行。","x":-1460,"y":-980,"width":700,"height":300,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"principles","type":"text","text":"## 宿主选择原则\n\n不是“怪物必须复用玩家 Slot”。\n\n- 玩家编队：`AGGYGOCharacterSlot`\n- 可换 Pawn 的 Boss：`AGGYGOBossState`\n- 普通怪物：Pawn 自持 ASC 仍可接受\n\n判断标准只有一个：**战斗状态要活多久**。\nPawn 会被替换而状态要保留，才把状态宿主上移。","x":-680,"y":-980,"width":500,"height":330,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"combatant","type":"text","text":"## `AGGYGOCombatantState`\n\n最小抽象基类（计划）：\n- ASC\n- HealthSet / CombatSet\n- 当前 Avatar 引用\n- Init / Clear Avatar\n- Owner/Avatar 复制与防重入守卫\n\n**不包含**队伍、AI、阶段、仇恨或 Boss 业务。\n`CharacterSlot` 与 `BossState` 只复用这一小段生命周期机制。","x":-80,"y":-980,"width":500,"height":390,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"slot","type":"text","text":"## 玩家分支\n\n`AGGYGOCharacterSlot : AGGYGOCombatantState`\n\n保留现有语义：\n- Owner = PlayerController\n- ASC = Mixed\n- PawnData / 队伍位置\n- 玩家预测\n\n这是对现有 D1 的抽取，不把队伍语义下沉到基类。","x":520,"y":-1040,"width":430,"height":300,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"bossstate","type":"text","text":"## Boss 状态宿主\n\n`AGGYGOBossState : AGGYGOCombatantState`\n\n持有：\n- BossDefinition\n- CurrentPhase / CurrentForm\n- 一次性机制状态\n- Minimal ASC\n\n不持有：\n- BehaviorTree\n- 感知/仇恨\n- PathFollowing\n\nASC 与属性只授予一次，换形态不重授予。","x":520,"y":-640,"width":430,"height":390,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"definition","type":"text","text":"## 数据定义\n\n`BossDefinition`\n- 全局 AbilitySet / Tag 关系\n- 初始 Phase / Form\n- PhaseDefinition 列表\n\n`BossFormDefinition`\n- PawnClass / PawnData\n- 形态 Tag、碰撞、移动、动画配置\n\n`BossPhaseDefinition`\n- 进入条件与阶段 Tag\n- 可用 ActionSet / 目标选择参数\n\n阶段与形态正交：转阶段不一定换 Pawn，换 Pawn 也不等于重置阶段。","x":1040,"y":-980,"width":520,"height":440,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"controller","type":"text","text":"## `AGGYGOBossAIController`\n\n跨形态持续存在：\n- Perception\n- ThreatComponent\n- CombatTargetComponent\n- Brain / BehaviorTree\n- PathFollowing\n\n换形态时只 UnPossess 旧 Pawn、Possess 新 Pawn；目标和仇恨不放进 Pawn，因此不会丢。","x":-1380,"y":-430,"width":490,"height":340,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"target","type":"text","text":"## 感知、仇恨与目标\n\nPerception 只产出候选者。\nThreat 维护服务器权威仇恨表。\nCombatTarget 暴露统一当前目标。\n\n约 0.6 ± 0.2 秒重评估目标；追踪/移动仍走 PathFollowing + CMC，不新增全局 Tick 调度器。","x":-1380,"y":40,"width":490,"height":330,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"bt","type":"text","text":"## BehaviorTree：只做决策\n\n通用外层：Idle / Sense / AcquireTarget / Combat / LeaveBattle\n\nBoss 战斗子树：\n- 距离、角度、阶段、形态过滤\n- 动态权重选择语义 ActionTag\n- 无合适动作时追击/调整站位\n\nBlackboard 只保留 Target、Home、Distance、Angle、DesiredAction 等少量可观察事实，不堆 `ShouldXxx`。","x":-760,"y":-430,"width":530,"height":430,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"bridge","type":"text","text":"## 决策 → GAS 桥\n\n`BTTask_ChooseBossAction`\n输出语义 ActionTag / AbilityHandle。\n\n`BTTask_ActivateBossAbility`\n向 ASC 请求激活，并等待 Ability 结束/取消。\n\nAI **不伪造 InputTag**，不调用玩家的 `ProcessAbilityInput`。\nGAS 的 TagRequirements、Cost、Cooldown、组仲裁才是最终准入。","x":-120,"y":-430,"width":520,"height":420,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"gas","type":"text","text":"## GAS 执行层\n\nBoss GA 使用 `ServerInitiated`：\n- Montage / GameplayEvent\n- 近战判定 / 投射物\n- GE / GameplayCue\n- Cost / Cooldown\n- 激活组与取消\n\n所有形态技能启动时一次性授予；用 `Phase.*` / `Form.*` Tag 控制激活。\n**冷却只有 GAS 一份真相**，BT 不再维护重复冷却。","x":500,"y":-90,"width":500,"height":440,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"avatars","type":"text","text":"## 形态 Pawn / Avatar\n\n每个形态可以有独立：\n- PawnClass、骨骼与 AnimBP\n- 碰撞与 CMC 配置\n- PawnExtension / HealthComponent\n- 形态专属表现组件\n\nPawn 只消费 BossState 注入的 ASC。\n换形态不是死亡，旧 Pawn 不发 `Event.Death`。","x":1080,"y":-340,"width":480,"height":360,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"handoff","type":"text","text":"## Avatar Handoff（服务器事务）\n\n1. 激活不可重入的 Exit/Transition Ability\n2. 加 `State.FormTransition`，阻断普通行动\n3. 冻结移动与受击边界，生成新 Pawn\n4. 旧 PawnExtension 清理绑定\n5. BossState 唯一一次 `InitAbilityActorInfo(BossState, NewPawn)`\n6. Controller Possess 新 Pawn，恢复 Target / Path\n7. 更新 Form Tag，激活 Enter Ability\n8. 成功后销毁旧 Pawn并解除阻断\n\n失败则回滚旧 Avatar；任何时刻只有 BossState 能写 Avatar。","x":1040,"y":140,"width":540,"height":560,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"network","type":"text","text":"## 权威与复制\n\n服务器权威：决策、仇恨、Phase、Form、Avatar、伤害。\n\n复制给客户端：\n- BossState / Avatar\n- CurrentPhase / CurrentForm\n- ASC Tag / GE / Cue / 属性\n- 过渡状态与必要表现事件\n\n客户端只表现，不预测 Boss 决策。Boss ASC 用 Minimal；玩家 Slot 继续 Mixed。","x":420,"y":500,"width":510,"height":380,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"guardrails","type":"text","text":"## 明确禁止\n\n- 不把 Boss 塞进玩家 CharacterSlot\n- 不让 BT 直接播 Montage、扣血或改 Tag\n- 不同时在 BT 与 GAS 维护冷却\n- 不用几十个布尔 Blackboard Key 复制隐式状态机\n- 不在 Form Pawn 上保存跨形态状态\n- 不让 Controller、Pawn 与 BossState 多方调用 `InitAbilityActorInfo`\n- 不新建全局每帧调度器\n\n详细验收清单见 [[BOSSAI计划蓝图#15. 审阅后冻结的检查项]]。","x":-760,"y":540,"width":560,"height":440,"color":"2"}
	],
